<section>
  <div class="col">
    <div class="sh"><span class="snum">1</span><h2>The approach</h2></div>
    <p class="lead">The offer is modular: you take only what your clip needs, from a simple shoot to the full cycle. That keeps the budget under control, with nothing paid for in excess.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="col">
    <div class="sh"><span class="snum">2</span><h2>Filming</h2></div>
    <div class="ptable">
      <div class="prow"><div class="pn">Filming, basic light<small>1 fixture, 60 and 100 W</small></div><div class="pp">50 € per hour</div></div>
      <div class="prow"><div class="pn">Filming, enhanced light<small>Three 500 W fixtures</small></div><div class="pp">70 € per hour</div></div>
      <div class="prow"><div class="pn">Fog machine</div><div class="pp">+20 €</div></div>
      <div class="prow"><div class="pn">Drone, aerial shots</div><div class="pp">+50 €</div></div>
    </div>
    <ul class="notes">
      <li><b>Light.</b> Basic (1 fixture, 60 and 100 W) suits one person in frame, indoors or outdoors. Three 500 W fixtures noticeably raise the image quality.</li>
      <li><b>Fog machine.</b> Atmospheric haze: the image gains depth and volume. Covers a room up to 100 m².</li>
      <li><b>Drone.</b> Aerial filming depends on the location: some zones are no-fly. We confirm in advance.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="col">
    <div class="sh"><span class="snum">3</span><h2>Script and pre-production</h2></div>
    <p class="lead">How deeply I'm involved in the idea is up to you. Three formats:</p>
    <div class="tiers">
      <div class="tier">
        <div class="th"><span class="tname">No script</span><span class="tprice">0 €</span></div>
        <p>The client handles all the prep: references, script, shot plan. On set I direct: I follow the ready plan, set the light and run the process. We shoot strictly to your script.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tier">
        <div class="th"><span class="tname">Involvement</span><span class="tprice">100 €</span></div>
        <p>You handle the organisation, locations and script and gather references. I give notes and suggest what works better. On set I cover the same: I run the filming to the plan and set the light.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tier">
        <div class="th"><span class="tname">Full service</span><span class="tprice">300 €</span></div>
        <p>I take on everything. First we discuss your wishes and ideas, then within a week or two I send references and several concept options. We refine over a few rounds to the final. Scouting locations and all approvals are on me too.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="col">
    <div class="sh"><span class="snum">4</span><h2>Editing</h2></div>
    <div class="callout">
      <div class="lbl">Guide</div>
      <div class="big">from 200 to 600 €</div>
    </div>
    <p class="lead">The price depends on a few things:</p>
    <ul class="notes">
      <li>the length of the track;</li>
      <li>the volume of footage and number of locations;</li>
      <li>the complexity the client sets (effects and so on).</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="lead">I give the exact figure after the script is approved. Editing includes footage selection, rhythm, colour correction, sound and 2 rounds of revisions.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="col">
    <div class="sh"><span class="snum">5</span><h2>Calculator</h2></div>
    <p class="lead">Tick what you need and see an approximate total. Editing can be switched off if you don't need it; the exact editing figure is fixed after the script.</p>

    <div class="calc">
      <div class="crow">
        <div class="cl"><div class="t">Script</div><div class="s">Idea, locations, approvals</div></div>
        <div class="ctrl">
          <select id="c-script" aria-label="Script">
            <option value="0">No script · 0 €</option>
            <option value="100">Involvement · 100 €</option>
            <option value="300">Full service · 300 €</option>
          </select>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="crow">
        <div class="cl"><div class="t">Filming</div><div class="s">Light mode</div></div>
        <div class="ctrl">
          <div class="seg">
            <input type="radio" name="light" id="l-no" value="50" checked><label for="l-no">Basic · 50 €/h</label>
            <input type="radio" name="light" id="l-yes" value="70"><label for="l-yes">Enhanced · 70 €/h</label>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="crow" style="border-top:none;padding-top:0;">
        <div class="cl"><div class="t">Filming hours</div></div>
        <div class="ctrl">
          <div class="stepper">
            <button type="button" id="h-minus" aria-label="Fewer hours">−</button>
            <input type="number" id="c-hours" value="2" min="1" max="12" inputmode="numeric" aria-label="Filming hours">
            <button type="button" id="h-plus" aria-label="More hours">+</button>
          </div>
          <span class="cprice on" id="p-shoot">100 €</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="crow">
        <div class="cl"><div class="t">Fog machine</div><div class="s">Atmospheric haze</div></div>
        <div class="ctrl">
          <span class="cprice" id="p-fog">20 €</span>
          <label class="sw"><input type="checkbox" id="c-fog" aria-label="Fog machine"><span class="track"></span></label>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="crow">
        <div class="cl"><div class="t">Drone</div><div class="s">Depends on location</div></div>
        <div class="ctrl">
          <span class="cprice" id="p-drone">50 €</span>
          <label class="sw"><input type="checkbox" id="c-drone" aria-label="Drone"><span class="track"></span></label>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="crow">
        <div class="cl"><div class="t">Editing</div><div class="s">from 200 to 600 €, exact after the script</div></div>
        <div class="ctrl">
          <span class="cprice on" id="p-montage">from 200 €</span>
          <label class="sw"><input type="checkbox" id="c-montage" checked aria-label="Editing"><span class="track"></span></label>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="crow">
        <div class="cl"><div class="t">Travel</div><div class="s">Beyond 50 km by arrangement</div></div>
        <div class="ctrl">
          <select id="c-travel" aria-label="Travel">
            <option value="20">In Riga · 20 €</option>
            <option value="50">Up to 20 km · 50 €</option>
            <option value="100">Up to 50 km · 100 €</option>
            <option value="100">Over 50 km · by arrangement</option>
          </select>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="total">
        <span class="lab">Approximately</span>
        <span class="val" id="c-total">from 320 €</span>
      </div>
      <p class="fine">Prices are final, PVN is not added. Editing can be switched off. When included, it's counted at the minimum (200 €) and can reach 600 € depending on complexity.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="col">
    <div class="sh"><span class="snum">6</span><h2>Sample estimate</h2></div>
    <div class="cards">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="ch">
          <div><div class="cname">Simple</div><div class="tg">Your idea</div></div>
          <span class="csum">from 320 €</span>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>The band's own idea</li>
          <li>One location in Riga</li>
          <li>About 2 hours of filming</li>
          <li>Clip editing</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="ch">
          <div><div class="cname">Medium</div><div class="tg">With light and haze</div></div>
          <span class="csum">from 700 €</span>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>Involvement in the script</li>
          <li>About 4 hours, enhanced light</li>
          <li>Fog machine for atmosphere</li>
          <li>Medium-complexity editing</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="ch">
          <div><div class="cname">Extended</div><div class="tg">Full cycle</div></div>
          <span class="csum">from 1100 €</span>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>Full-service script</li>
          <li>Two locations, light, drone</li>
          <li>Fog machine</li>
          <li>Editing with effects</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="lead" style="color:var(--muted);font-size:14.5px;">These are just examples of how an estimate adds up. The total depends on the scope you choose.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="col">
    <div class="sh"><span class="snum">7</span><h2>Terms</h2></div>
    <ul class="cond">
      <li><b>Prices are final,</b> PVN is not added.</li>
      <li><b>Payment.</b> Script 100 % upfront. Filming: 20 % deposit, 80 % on the shoot day. Editing: 50 % at the end of the shoot day, 50 % on delivery.</li>
      <li><b>Timeline.</b> Script about a week, two at most. The finished clip usually within 2 weeks after filming. If you need a rush, we arrange it separately.</li>
      <li><b>Shoot days.</b> A clip can be filmed in one day or a few hours, or across several days.</li>
      <li><b>Travel.</b> In Riga 20 €. Up to 20 km from Riga 50 €, up to 50 km 100 €, further by arrangement.</li>
      <li><b>Revisions.</b> 2 rounds included. If no notes arrive within a week of the sent version, it is considered accepted.</li>
      <li><b>Offer valid for:</b> 30 days.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="close">
  <div class="col">
    <p class="cta">Open to discussing the idea and project details. Write to me and we'll put together a version for you.</p>
    <div class="contacts">
      <div class="who">Andrey <span>· Flora Creative Studio</span></div>
      <div>Call or WhatsApp: <a href="tel:+37127775842">+371 27 775 842</a></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script is:inline src="../../app.js" defer></script>


